OL,3,AHints of fiery finale for last ever
OL,4,Aepisode of River City
OL,5,
OL,6,FJohnny McKnight has written for River
OL,7,FCity for almost a decade so, when it
OL,8,Fwas announced that the show was drawing
OL,9,Fto a close after 24 years, he asked if
OL,10,Fhe could write the final episode.
OL,12,F"Those moments don't come up very often
OL,13,Fwith long-running shows so I thought it
OL,14,Fmight be cathartic and a nice way to
OL,15,Fsay goodbye as a writer," he says.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,164,160,200,105,0,100
