OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AHints of fiery finale for last ever
OL,4,Aepisode of River City
OL,5,
OL,6,FDetails of the episode, which will air
OL,7,Fon Monday, are a closely-guarded secret
OL,8,Fbut images released showing a bloodied
OL,9,FLenny Murdoch amidst a dramatic fire
OL,10,Fscene suggest the show's arch-villain,
OL,11,Fplayed by Frank Gallagher, is at the
OL,12,Fcentre of it.
OL,14,FHe said he felt a huge responsibility
OL,15,Fto the show's fans to give them a
OL,16,Fsatisfying ending.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
